      "- **Eight or more a month** makes sense in competitive markets or for businesses with many services and service areas.",
      "Consistency beats bursts. Two good posts every month for a year will do more than twenty posts in January followed by silence.",
      "![A contractor writing blog ideas in a notebook at a small home office desk in the evening](/blog/img/how-often-should-a-business-blog-1.webp \"The best blog topics come from the questions customers ask you every week.\")",
      "## What to write about",
      "The best topics come straight from your work. Here are reliable categories, with examples for a GTA contractor:",
