      "- Is it written for people first, rather than to rank for a keyword?",
      "![A tradesperson recording voice notes about a job that will become a blog post](/blog/img/ai-written-content-that-ranks-2.webp \"Your real experience is the ingredient AI can't supply.\")",
      "## What about volume?",
      "AI makes it tempting to publish dozens of posts a week. Resist. A smaller number of strong, specific, well-edited pages beats a flood of thin ones, and it avoids the scaled-content problems Google targets. Aim for consistency and quality. See [how often a contractor should blog](/blog/how-often-should-a-business-blog).",
      "## Should you disclose AI use?",
