    metaDescription: "No time to write blog posts or social updates? A simple content system for busy contractors: capture photos, voice notes and customer questions on the job, and turn them into content that brings in leads.",
    excerpt: "You don't need to become a writer to have great content. You need a simple way to capture what you already do. Here's the system.",
