      "![A homeowner in a basement looking frustrated at a slowly loading website on her phone](/blog/img/website-speed-costs-customers-1.webp \"People searching for a contractor are often in a hurry, and on mobile data.\")",
      "## How to test your website's speed",
      "You can check your site for free in a couple of minutes:",
